<p>Russia&#x27;s Defense Ministry said its forces had taken full control of Ukraine&#x27;s Luhansk region, one of four Ukrainian regions Moscow says it annexed in 2022. Ukrainian officials rejected the claim, and Reuters, as cited by SCMP, said it could not independently verify the battlefield report. The dispute surfaced as Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy prepared for talks with U.S. representatives working to help mediate an end to Russia&#x27;s invasion.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Nd0e2ZOsHBpvZps-3pQvG_NOaK_zZ_wX1u7mpftD6eVBS5fmuB4SdVaovJwcWW5Rgsc5Acs_i8FUvPfZ388CFswA--6uTF6tCL5LaKJlMdeuq8uALxB28DvO6UMd6ZJytSnJpaDlMhfrcF2t3GP5vi7kRwdMqZauOOnFT2MvlRZxqsRQwC9SsnoFy30BrM7juaOhpFUudmFZUARoZDZ9GuOqnHVO7VXoVBDxu5Ejp7rwgplrgVEOBg' alt='Image accompanying coverage of Ukraine&#x27;s denial of Russia&#x27;s Luhansk claim' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Last pocket: SCMP said Moscow&#x27;s announcement suggested Russian forces had captured a small sliver of Luhansk that had remained outside their control since 2022.</li><li>Near-total control already: Before this latest claim, Russia already controlled more than 99% of Luhansk, according to SCMP.</li><li>Six-month stalemate claim: A Ukrainian military spokesman told SCMP there had been no battlefield changes in that area for the past six months.</li><li>Brigade holdouts: AP reported that Ukraine&#x27;s 3rd Assault Brigade said it still held a small number of positions near the front line.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3348720/russia-says-it-has-taken-full-control-ukraines-luhansk-region'>Russia says it has taken full control of Ukraine’s Luhansk region</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/kyiv-denies-russian-claims-of-full-control-over-ukraines-luhansk-region-ahead-of-u-s-envoy-talks'>Kyiv denies Russian claims of full control over Ukraine&#x27;s Luhansk region ahead of U.S. envoy talks</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://apnews.com/article/russia-ukraine-war-luhansk-us-talks-drones-d78a7b78203130ddef11757e7df88abe'>The Russian defence ministry says its forces have taken full control of Luhansk Oblast in eastern Ukraine. The Ukrainian military denies this claim, saying its 3rd Assault Brigade continues to hold a small number of positions near the front line.</a> - apnews.com</li></ul>